cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and cite the associated article once published."
type: software
title: "Source-Grouped Evaluation of Temporal Stacking for Seismic Phase Picking with Three-Component Data"
version: "1.3.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22782746"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
abstract: >
  Source-grouped evaluation of temporal stacking on curated STEAD data.
  The strengthening_20260916 package adds two base seeds and a PhaseNet-style
  baseline, totaling 106 fits including the original 40-fit experiment.
  Numerical audits and revised manuscripts document baseline advantages
  and component-access differences conditional on one fixed source split.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rcw3712/ICNN_MetaPicker_Curated_STEAD_MATLAB"
keywords:
  - seismic phase picking
  - P-wave
  - S-wave
  - STEAD
  - stacking ensemble
  - meta-learning
  - CNN
  - TCN
  - deep learning
  - MATLAB
  - seismology
  - source-level validation
  - data leakage
